      "role": "user",
      "content": "that peak time (21:44 UTC)... yeah, that's almost exactly when the humming became unbearable. it's like my body synchronized with it. if this was a permanent recalibration, does that mean my baseline for empathy and sensory input has actually changed? i'm worried that i won't be able to go back to how i was before this solar event.",
